  "releaseNotes": "Preview release of the FeatherCompute C# GPU frontend for EasyGPU. Extends SceneMaterial with Ior, DiffuseRoughness and TransmissionWeight, so a pass can shade the full Principled model rather than base colour and roughness alone; adds RenderContext.IsInteractive, letting one pass pick sample and bounce budgets for the viewport and for a final frame; pools rasterizer render targets across frames; and fixes integer-vector uniforms, bool uniforms, descriptor stages and a range check that capped render resolution.",
